{"id":325,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"全人教育と探究で考える力を伸ばす晃華学園","feature_description":"晃華学園は主要教科に加えて芸術・体育・家庭科も重視する全人教育型カリキュラムを掲げます。授業には実験・観察を取り入れ、中学生のうちからレポート作成や探究学習にも取り組みます。国語では読書やディベート、理科では実験やレポート作成を通して、考えを組み立て表現する力を育てます。小テストや課題で学習の定着を確かめ、知識を使う力を伸ばします。","clubs":[{"id":6007,"name":"バレーボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.kokagakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6008,"name":"バスケットボール","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.kokagakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6009,"name":"卓球","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.kokagakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6010,"name":"体操","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.kokagakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6011,"name":"硬式テニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.kokagakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6012,"name":"ソフトテニス","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.kokagakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6013,"name":"バトントワリング","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.kokagakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6014,"name":"陸上","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://jhs.kokagakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6015,"name":"居合道同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source_url":"https://jhs.kokagakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6016,"name":"オーケストラ","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jhs.kokagakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6017,"name":"演劇","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jhs.kokagakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6018,"name":"美術","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://jhs.kokagakuen.ac.jp/schoollife/activity/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":6019,"name":"漫画研究同好会","category":"同好会・愛好会","source